# Block by KIND, never by directory name.
#
# Blocking */scripts/ or */experiments/ keeps generators out of version control, and
# then two contract fields become unsatisfiable: local.source_roots is defined as
# version-controlled roots, and every promoted figure must cite its generator's
# code_revision.

# Regenerable outputs, any depth
**/cache/
**/cache_*/
**/results/
**/results_*/
**/runs/
**/checkpoints/
**/log_files/
**/analysis-output/

# Environments and build trees
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/node_modules/**
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/target/
*.pyc

# data/ holds manifests and pointers only
**/data/**
!**/data/*.yml
!**/data/*.yaml
!**/data/*.md
!**/data-manifest.yml

# Serialized tensors, datasets, archives, binaries
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.onnx
*.bin
*.so
*.dylib
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.gz
*.db

# Secrets and local noise
.env
.DS_Store

# Figure metadata records local absolute paths
**/run.json
